  "answer_text": "Here is some information about **\"Still in Love with You\"** by **Brooks & Dunn**:\n\n- **\"Still in Love with You\"** is a **1991 song** by Brooks & Dunn, from their album ***Brand New Man***.\n\n- It is the **tenth track** on *Brand New Man*.\n\nThe song is a heartfelt country ballad about a man who, despite leaving a relationship, cannot shake his feelings. The chorus features the memorable lines about wishing he could ride off into the sunset or fly away, but knowing he'd \"wake up still in love with you.\"\n\nYou can listen to the song on **[Spotify](https://open.spotify.com/track/5nTh5z1Uac2istxVmX3qH8)** or watch it on **[YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iyk_dM9CbUY)**.\n\nWould you like to know more about the song, the album, or Brooks & Dunn in general?",
